## 11. 发车参数组装

`toCreateRecord` 是发车主流程。

### 11.1 参数结构

```ts
const obj = {
  businessAreaId,
  deliveryAutoPortBuildingType: ["STATION", "PICKUPPOINT", "THIRDPOST"],
  operateType: "Transport",
  transportParam: {
    parcelNum: ordCnt,
    fileList: fileList?.map(item => item?.ossKey),
    returnToHubParam: {
      parking: stopoverPointListArray[2] && stopoverPointListArray[2].length ? {
        lineType: stopoverPointListArray[2][0]?.lineType,
        utpAutoportId: stopoverPointListArray[2][0]?.utpAutoportId,
        parkingSpotId: stopoverPointListArray[2][0]?.parkingSpotId
      } : null
    },
    needReturn: true,
    targetAutoports: (
      isDeliveryFirst
        ? [...stopoverPointListArray[0], ...stopoverPointListArray[1]]
        : [...stopoverPointListArray[1], ...stopoverPointListArray[0]]
    )?.map(item => ({
      utpAutoportId: item.staId,
      businessInputParkingParam: {},
      targetIntent: ['POST_POINT', 'STATION', 'THIRDPOST'].includes(item?.type)
        ? 'WaybillPost'
        : 'WaybillPick'
    }))
  },
  udid,
  dispatchType: dispatchType === 'loop' ? '' : 'UTP_AUTO_PORT_DISPATCH',
  utpAutoPortDispatchVOList: null,
};
```

核心转换关系：

| 前端节点 | 发车参数 |
|----------|----------|
| 派送点 `POST_POINT` | `targetIntent: 'WaybillPost'` |
| 三方派送点 `THIRDPOST` | `targetIntent: 'WaybillPost'` |
| 揽收点 `PICK_POINT` | `targetIntent: 'WaybillPick'` |
| 返程点 `END_POINT` | `returnToHubParam.parking` |

### 11.2 非 loop 场景补充 dispatch 列表

```ts
if (dispatchType !== 'loop') {
  const targetList = obj.transportParam.targetAutoports
    ?.map(item => ({ utpAutoportId: item.utpAutoportId })) || [];
  const backPointList = (stopoverPointListArray[2] || [])
    .filter(item => item?.utpAutoportId)
    .map(item => ({ utpAutoportId: item.utpAutoportId }));
  obj.utpAutoPortDispatchVOList = [...targetList, ...backPointList];
}
```

这个字段更像是给调度侧的完整停靠点列表：任务点 + 返程点。这样后端既能拿到业务意图 `targetAutoports`，也能拿到完整调度点序列。

### 11.3 创建接口不等于成功

调用：

```ts
const createRes = await createRecordNew(obj);
if (!createRes?.data?.dispatchRequestResult?.requestId ||
  (createRes?.data?.dispatchRequestResult?.requestId &&
    (String(createRes?.data?.dispatchRequestResult?.detectPass) === 'false' ||
      String(createRes?.data?.dispatchRequestResult?.accept) === 'false'))) {
  CnMessage.show({
    content: createRes?.data?.dispatchRequestResult?.errorMsg || '发车失败'
  });
  return;
}
```

判断条件：

- 没有 `requestId`：创建失败。
- `detectPass === false`：前置检测不通过。
- `accept === false`：调度系统不接受。

只有 requestId 存在且检测 / 接受都不为 false，才继续轮询调度状态。

